    <bpmn:process id="W_W1900" name="W1900. Contractor Safety Training &amp; Compliance Certification Support" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DOLE safety training requirements; contractor request for safety certification support
Frequency: Quarterly safety training sessions
Volume: ~200–400 contractors trained/year
Owner: VP Store Operations
Participants: VP Store Operations, Safety Officer, DOLE-Accredited Trainer, Trade Professionals
Source: workflow W1900 — Contractor Safety Training &amp; Compliance Certification Support</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1900_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1900_Lane1" name="VP Store Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1900_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1900_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1900_Lane2" name="Safety Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1900_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1900_Lane3" name="AM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1900_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1900_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1900_Start5" name="DOLE safety training requirements; contractor request for safety certification support">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1900_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1900_Task6" name="VP Store Operations plans quarterly safety training: (a) partner with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Store Operations plans quarterly safety training: (a) partner with DOLE-accredited safety training organization, (b) topics: construction safety (working at heights, electrical safety, excavation safety), PPE selection and usage (BuildRight PPE products featured), hazard identification, (c) offer as value-added benefit to trade accounts: free or subsidized training for Gold/Platinum members
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1900_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1900_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1900_Task7" name="Execute safety training: (a) DOLE-accredited trainer conducts session, (b)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute safety training: (a) DOLE-accredited trainer conducts session, (b) BuildRight Safety Officer presents PPE product knowledge, (c) contractors receive attendance certificate (usable for DOLE compliance requirements), (d) loyalty points awarded for attendance
Responsible (R): Safety Officer / Trainer
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Half-day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1900_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1900_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1900_Task8" name="Post-training: (a) track PPE sales to attendees — did training increase PPE…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Post-training: (a) track PPE sales to attendees — did training increase PPE purchases from BuildRight?, (b) safety training as differentiator: contractors appreciate value-added service that helps their business compliance
Responsible (R): AM
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1900_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1900_End9" name="Complete">
